  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dealing With a Case of Incest",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is actually reported that there is sexual immorality among you, and of a kind that even pagans do not tolerate: A man is sleeping with his father's wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you are proud! Shouldn't you rather have gone into mourning and have put out of your fellowship the man who has been doing this?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For my part, even though I am not physically present, I am with you in spirit. As one who is present with you in this way, I have already passed judgment in the name of our Lord Jesus on the one who has been doing this.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So when you are assembled and I am with you in spirit, and the power of our Lord Jesus is present,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hand this man over to Satan for the destruction of the flesh,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "so that his spirit may be saved on the day of the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Your boasting is not good. Don't you know that a little yeast leavens the whole batch of dough?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get rid of the old yeast, so that you may be a new unleavened batch—as you really are. For Christ, our Passover lamb, has been sacrificed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore let us keep the Festival, not with the old bread leavened with malice and wickedness, but with the unleavened bread of sincerity and truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I wrote to you in my letter not to associate with sexually immoral people—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not at all meaning the people of this world who are immoral, or the greedy and swindlers, or idolaters. In that case you would have to leave this world.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now I am writing to you that you must not associate with anyone who claims to be a brother or sister",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "but is sexually immoral or greedy, an idolater or slanderer, a drunkard or swindler. Do not even eat with such people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What business is it of mine to judge those outside the church? Are you not to judge those inside?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God will judge those outside. \"Expel the wicked person from among you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "1CO.6",
    "number": "6",
    "bookId": "1CO"
  },
